# Base URL of the ASP.NET Core API.
# This project has NO Properties/launchSettings.json, so Kestrel listens on http://localhost:5000
# in Development. The previous example value (https://localhost:7001) did not match any port the
# app was configured to bind, so a fresh clone failed to reach the API.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000

# PRODUCTION: point this at your deployed HTTPS API, e.g. VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# The official OM Stationary pickup location, delivery radius and store details are configured
# server-side (StoreSettingsService / appsettings). Never hardcode them here.
